        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/so#biosapiens"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Range. Old definition from before biosapiens: A region of a single polypeptide chain that folds into an independent unit and exhibits biological activity. A polypeptide chain may have multiple domains.</rdfs:comment>
